          "street": "a) KM5, Bangui, Central African Republic b) Nana-Grebizi, Central African Republic c) Ndjari, Ndjamena, Chad d) Ndélé, Bamingui-Bangoran (main location since August 2016)",
          "country": "Bamingui-Bangoran (main location since August 2016)"
        }
      ]
    },
