      "remarks": "TAi.096 Title: Mullah. Designation: Governor of Kandahar Province under the Taliban regime. Has a prosthetic right leg. Member of Taliban Supreme Council as of mid-2013, acted as deputy of Mullah Mohammed Omar (TI.O.4.01) in Mar. 2010. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area.  Belongs to Achekzai tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 23 Jul. 2010. Deceased as of 9 February 2016.; Listing: Listed on 23 February 2001 (amended on 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011 and 31 Dec. 2013, 7 Sep. 2016)",
